      "message": "Dear Sir，\n\nThese fields are mainly used for record informations about the lock owner. So, this may hardly increase risk to the kernel code.\n\nOur \"optimize\" are more android specific, that may not suits for the upstream kernel. We mark the foreground tasks such as the surfaceflinger with the higher priority for some locks, these may take no advatages for linux widely used in other equipments.",
