      "writtenOn": "2021-05-23T10:16:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dear Mr. Todd,\n\nI don\u0027t know if there are some ways to analysis the memory cost indroduced by the lock change easily.\n\nI was tried to add statistics to __mutex_init and __init_rwsem to see how much locks were initialized. But I found that I can\u0027t make statistics at the end of the lock use. And then the statistic is continuously increasing on my device.\n\nDo you have some suggestions on how to do the analysis? I will be very willing to try.",
      "parentUuid": "cd5fc719_d31ef93e",
      "revId": "541080d9ef908200cb9c81a2fd669cbeb79dca3c",
